	(text "FPV camera power (TA request 2026-10-28, optional): 2-pin 2.54 mm male header (TA 2026-10-29, so a different connector can be spliced), 5 V from the main 5V rail (U740), 250-500 mA.\nF701 PTC keeps a camera fault from pulling down the Pi 5V rail. Pin 1 = +5V, pin 2 = GND."
